  "entries": [
    "You accelerate the processes of decay in the area. Each living creature in the area takes 2d10 negative damage (basic Fortitude save). A creature afflicted by a disease takes a –2 circumstance penalty to this save.",
    "You can also direct the blight to rot all Small and Tiny non-creature plants in the area, eliminating non-magical undergrowth and any resulting terrain, cover, and concealment. Sudden blight attempts to counteract any magical effect on the plants before withering them."
